203\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/088e/7b93/535399_normal.png?m=1614594748\" alt=\"harry90\" data-uid=\"535399\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>4</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/harry90\">harry90</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-08-07 09:30:36 +08:00\">22h 50m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>比水还便宜的 token 就是这么来的吧 你想要 搞中专的更想要</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_17947408\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/9c27/de09/118414_normal.png?m=1765273969\" alt=\"tanxiaoluo\" data-uid=\"118414\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>8</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/tanxiaoluo\">tanxiaoluo</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-08-07 10:01:18 +08:00\">22h 20m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>@<a href=\"/member/kera0a\">kera0a</a> #1 羡慕了，目前比较低门槛的要么去 gate 办一张 U 卡，需要自己的 KYC ，要么去某鱼买 plasma 卡，黑哥的 KYC ，绑定你自己的邮箱。这两个我都付成功过 GPT</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_17947466\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/b8ce/9f31/585950_normal.png?m=1745484378\" alt=\"jonty\" data-uid=\"585950\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>9</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/jonty\">jonty</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-08-07 10:08:07 +08:00\">22h 13m ago</span> \